      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. You might picture a skill as a prompt Claude reads. It isn't. It's a folder Claude finds — SKILL.md at the root, references and scripts and assets beside it, loaded on demand. What lives in that folder decides whether Claude reaches for the skill at all, and whether the skill stays cheap to load or bloats every session it fires in.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 24.0,
